/* Contact requests (docs/PHASE4_DESIGN.md §6.1): a section of the contacts pane, and, for the selected request, the header's block with Godta and Avslå: one click each, no Touch ID. A request carries no text: only the asker's address and code, drawn in the protected layer. */
